WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.360
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:05.764
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.764 --> 00:00:09.264
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.264 --> 00:00:09.611
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.611 --> 00:00:11.973
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:11.973 --> 00:00:15.628
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:15.636 --> 00:00:20.336
Try an incorrect word in the first sentence.

00:00:20.336 --> 00:00:25.852
Check the first answer and read the explanation.

00:00:25.852 --> 00:00:29.418
Reveal a hint for the inference sentence.

00:00:29.418 --> 00:00:33.788
Replace the first answer with parameters.

00:00:33.788 --> 00:00:37.767
Describe ordinary inference with fixed parameters.

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:41.911
Complete the third sentence with context.

00:00:41.911 --> 00:00:44.642
Check all completed sentences together.

00:00:44.642 --> 00:00:50.387
Inspect the complete 3/3 result and final explanation.

00:00:50.387 --> 00:00:57.438
Reset the exercise for a fresh attempt.
